      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MOTHER GEORGIA (6) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 0.7 lengths at Ballarat in a handy 22.00 beating Special Envoy. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Looks the one to beat. KAELIX JEWEL (1) ran below best last time finishing seventh (26.13) over 450m at this track from Box 1. Boasts two wins from four starts out of this box. Expected to run well. CANYA KICK IT (3) was a quick 22.56 winner of a Grade 4/5 at Geelong last start. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. BELMONDO BLUE (8) has definite claims at her first try at this circuit.",
